<code>assert \forall int i; index <= i && i < \old(this.size()); (this.get(i) == null && \old(this.get(i-1)) == null) || this.get(i).equals(\old(this.get(i-1)));</code>

This assert statement captures the condition that for every valid index `i` from the insertion point to the previous size of the vector, the element at position `i` in the updated vector is either `null` and the corresponding old element at position `i-1` is `null`, or it is equal to the old element at position `i-1`. Note that the condition is adjusted to account for the shift caused by the insertion.
